# Description

This change fixes function calling with Vertex LLM. Function call responses from the model were not being properly included in the subsequent prompt, causing the model to keep calling the same function. The function call response is now correctly included in prompt. 

Prompt before
```
[role: "user"
parts {
    text: "You are a helpful assistant answering users questions. If the user provides a feedback, use the store_feedback tool to store the feedback."
}
, role: "model"
parts {
    text: "Function Calling"
}
, role: "user"
parts {
    text: "Thank you for providing feedback"
}
]
```

Prompt after
```
[role: "user"
parts {
  text: "You are a helpful assistant answering users questions. If the user provides a feedback, use the store_feedback tool to store the feedback."
}
, role: "model"
parts {
  function_call {
    name: "store_feedback"
    args {
      fields {
        key: "feedback_text"
        value {
          string_value: "The response was not helpful"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
, role: "user"
parts {
  text: "Thank you for providing feedback"
}
]
```

